  m_text: 'Gesture 3: Duplicate

    In the simulation, there might come a time when
    you need to duplicate an object. Objects that can be duplicated will automatically
    create a copy when you grab them with one hand and place them a little further
    away. Give it a try, and you''ll see what I mean. Do you see the green cylinder-shaped
    object in front of you? Go ahead and grab it, then gently place it in a slightly
    different location!'
