    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Gesture 2: Grab and Drop

    Great job mastering touch gestures! Now
    it''s time to learn the Grab and Drop gesture. Do you see the yellow cube in
    front of you? Try grabbing the cube and moving it over to the twinkling yellow
    star-shaped light on the right. It''s similar to dragging and dropping with a
    mouse. When the cube touches the light, a green circular loading bar will start
    filling up! Once the circle is full, you''ll see another twinkling yellow star-shaped
    light on the left. Just like before, grab the cube and move it over there to
    complete the task.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
