  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Gesture 1: Touch

    Hey there! Do you see those red round objects in
    front of you? Why not get closer and give them a gentle touch with your hand?
    As you touch them, you''ll notice a green circle filling up. Keep on touching
    until the circle is full! Once it''s filled, the objects will disappear. Make
    all the round objects disappear, and you''ll ace the touch gesture tutorial!'
